    "description": "Welcome to Four Square St Heliers, a local supermarket owned and operated by fourth-generation grocer Stacey Huston and her partner Troy. Located in the village center we offer a variety of fresh and healthy foods, including real fruit ice creams, barista-made coffee, deli sandwiches, pastries, and hot food to go. We host a series of free in store community events and get involved in sponsoring a large number of clubs, schools and events and provides food to 'Everybody Eats' in Glen Innes.",
